<!--
  RM_Mullgoth.xml                              SWB_RM_FAUNA_DECIDE_HOME_LIKE_CHIKKA

  The mullgoth (our port of Alpha Animals AA_Wildpod) is not a Star Wars creature.
  Owner 2026-10-24: "Yes, it appears that a lot of alpha animal ports got
  classified as Star Wars. We should move all of those. Durrok and Mullgoth and
  Vura do need moving out of Star Wars, yes." It moved here, block verbatim, from
  src/RimStarWars/SWBestiary/Defs/DesertPort/RSW_DesertPortMisc_Races.xml.

  defName RM_Mullgoth is unchanged, so a save holding one still resolves it while
  this mod is active; no alias is needed. texPaths are unchanged: the pictures
  moved to this mod's Textures/ at the same relative path through the art ledger.
-->
<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
