		<defName>RM_Mullgoth</defName>
		<label>mullgoth</label>
		<description>A low, domed animal on four thick legs, draped in pale hair and patched with grey-green moss and lilac lichen. Black slime drips from its belly. Bullets pass through its bulk with little effect, but its coat burns readily.</description>
